{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39649252",
      "title": "Rendering Content Conditionally",
      "sourceHash": "3d2ec1665c7f1f86e6af11505b4448061d72a5499aafc8fe0e580ce2983f40ed",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.66,
          "end": 3.3,
          "en": "So we're now able to output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.3,
          "end": 7.143,
          "en": "different data here based on which button was pressed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.98,
          "end": 10.98,
          "en": "And initially, when this page first loads,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.98,
          "end": 14.28,
          "en": "we displayed this Components data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.28,
          "end": 16.74,
          "en": "And this, is of course, absolutely fine",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.74,
          "end": 19.32,
          "en": "and there is nothing wrong with this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 22.56,
          "en": "But maybe this is not the behavior we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.56,
          "end": 26.7,
          "en": "Maybe we don't want to show this Components data initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.7,
          "end": 29.13,
          "en": "but instead we might prefer to show",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.13,
          "end": 31.44,
          "en": "some info text initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.44,
          "end": 34.59,
          "en": "something like, please select a topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.59,
          "end": 36.48,
          "en": "And therefore here in our state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.48,
          "end": 40.14,
          "en": "the initial value should maybe be an empty string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.14,
          "end": 43.68,
          "en": "to signal that we haven't selected anything yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.68,
          "end": 48.03,
          "en": "or null, or simply no value at all",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.03,
          "end": 51.543,
          "en": "so that we don't have an initially selected topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.86,
          "end": 56.88,
          "en": "But of course, if I saved this, the page breaks again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 58.44,
          "en": "So what we need to do now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.44,
          "end": 62.79,
          "en": "is something you'll need to do a lot in React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.79,
          "end": 66.96,
          "en": "We need to output some content conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.96,
          "end": 70.034,
          "en": "I only want to output this markup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.034,
          "end": 72.93,
          "en": "with this data inside of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.93,
          "end": 77.93,
          "en": "if we have a selected topic, not otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.21000000000001,
          "end": 80.78999999999999,
          "en": "And I wanna output some fallback text,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.78999999999999,
          "end": 85.78999999999999,
          "en": "like please select a topic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 86.25,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "if we haven't picked a topic yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 93.87,
          "en": "So we want to either use this code and show this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.87,
          "end": 97.32300000000001,
          "en": "or use this code and show this information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.25,
          "end": 101.28,
          "en": "And as mentioned, outputting content conditionally",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.28,
          "end": 103.65,
          "en": "is something you'll do a lot in React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 103.65,
          "end": 105.57,
          "en": "And there are different approaches",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.57,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "for implementing this feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 110.1,
          "en": "The first way of showing this paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.1,
          "end": 113.58,
          "en": "only if we have no selected topic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 113.58,
          "end": 117.87,
          "en": "is to add curly braces here, opening and closing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.87,
          "end": 120.93,
          "en": "to output some dynamic content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "and to then use ternary expression.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 127.02,
          "en": "And we could then use this selected topic state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.02,
          "end": 130.05,
          "en": "which initially is undefined here in my case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.05,
          "end": 133.593,
          "en": "since I am not setting an initial value anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.97,
          "end": 138.63,
          "en": "And we could check if this is equal to undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.63,
          "end": 141.06,
          "en": "Or shorter in JavaScript,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.06,
          "end": 144.03,
          "en": "simply add an exclamation mark in front of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 144.03,
          "end": 146.943,
          "en": "to check if it's not truthy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.17000000000002,
          "end": 150.9,
          "en": "And then here we can use ternary expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.9,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "to show this fallback text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 158.313,
          "en": "if selected topic is not truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 159.18,
          "end": 161.79,
          "en": "and show null otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 161.79,
          "end": 165.39,
          "en": "And null is something you can output in JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 169.053,
          "en": "it'll simply lead to nothing being rendered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 170.993,
          "en": "So with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 170.993,
          "end": 174.51,
          "en": "we're saying if we don't have a selected topic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 174.51,
          "end": 176.373,
          "en": "render this paragraph here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.63,
          "end": 179.763,
          "en": "Otherwise, render nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 182.34,
          "en": "And we might wanna do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 182.34,
          "end": 185.73,
          "en": "instead of showing this entire div here actually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 185.73,
          "end": 188.46,
          "en": "because now we wanna show that div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.46,
          "end": 190.53,
          "en": "if the opposite condition is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 190.53,
          "end": 193.143,
          "en": "So if selected topic is truthy,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195,
          "end": 197.57999999999998,
          "en": "if this is not equal to undefined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 197.57999999999998,
          "end": 201.963,
          "en": "or shorter in JavaScript, if it's truthy, written like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.67000000000002,
          "end": 208.413,
          "en": "And then if that's the case, we wanna render this div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.66,
          "end": 212.403,
          "en": "So we paste that in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 216.153,
          "en": "And otherwise, we render nothing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 217.62,
          "end": 220.323,
          "en": "And after formatting, this code looks like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.22,
          "end": 224.37,
          "en": "So now we have these two opposite conditions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.37,
          "end": 229.37,
          "en": "where we either render this paragraph or this div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.79,
          "end": 232.44,
          "en": "And of course, we could also merge this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.44,
          "end": 235.05,
          "en": "into one single ternary expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 235.05,
          "end": 237.69,
          "en": "and simply take this div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.69,
          "end": 239.82,
          "en": "and render this instead of null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.82,
          "end": 240.653,
          "en": "Because in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 240.653,
          "end": 243.363,
          "en": "this is the alternative to showing this message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 244.32,
          "end": 246.66,
          "en": "So we could shorten this code like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 246.66,
          "end": 248.58,
          "en": "Both approaches would be valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.58,
          "end": 251.013,
          "en": "And with that, if you save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 252.3,
          "end": 256.05,
          "en": "you see please select a topic initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 256.05,
          "end": 258.06,
          "en": "And you see that we don't have any error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 258.06,
          "end": 259.443,
          "en": "in the console anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 260.73,
          "end": 264.57,
          "en": "But if I press Components or JSX or any other button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 264.57,
          "end": 267.843,
          "en": "I see the respective topics content here instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.78,
          "end": 273.813,
          "en": "So this is one way of rendering content conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 275.13,
          "end": 279.78,
          "en": "An alternative would be to go back to that approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.78,
          "end": 284.78,
          "en": "where I used two dynamic segments here, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 285.87,
          "end": 289.32,
          "en": "And to still write this in a more concise way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 289.32,
          "end": 293.913,
          "en": "by omitting this else case here, in this case null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 294.81,
          "end": 296.79,
          "en": "And instead of using a question mark here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 296.79,
          "end": 299.22,
          "en": "we can use two ampersand symbols,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 299.22,
          "end": 301.86,
          "en": "so the logical AND operator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 301.86,
          "end": 303.51,
          "en": "And with this syntax,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 303.51,
          "end": 306.9,
          "en": "we're using a little trick in JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 306.9,
          "end": 310.74,
          "en": "Because the AND operator will actually output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 310.74,
          "end": 312.9,
          "en": "the value that comes after it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 312.9,
          "end": 315.513,
          "en": "if the condition in front of it yields true.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 316.74,
          "end": 319.35,
          "en": "So if we don't have a selected topic,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 319.35,
          "end": 322.11,
          "en": "this paragraph will be output.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 322.11,
          "end": 326.37,
          "en": "And down here, we could therefore also use the AND operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 326.37,
          "end": 328.62,
          "en": "and remove this else case.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 328.62,
          "end": 330.933,
          "en": "And therefore also write this like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 332.04,
          "end": 334.11,
          "en": "And if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 334.11,
          "end": 336.033,
          "en": "we got the same behavior as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 337.47,
          "end": 339.75,
          "en": "It's up to you which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 339.75,
          "end": 344.19,
          "en": "This can be shorter than using a ternary expression.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 344.19,
          "end": 346.05,
          "en": "And using these two segments",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 346.05,
          "end": 348.69,
          "en": "instead of one combined ternary expression",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 348.69,
          "end": 352.83,
          "en": "can lead to more readable and understandable code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 352.83,
          "end": 355.89300000000003,
          "en": "which is why I wanted to show this approach here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 356.97,
          "end": 359.94,
          "en": "But there also is a last alternative,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 359.94,
          "end": 362.43,
          "en": "and I'm showing you all these alternatives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 362.43,
          "end": 364.83,
          "en": "because you'll see all these alternatives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 364.83,
          "end": 366.48,
          "en": "in real React projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 366.48,
          "end": 368.34,
          "en": "and you therefore need to know about them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 368.34,
          "end": 369.963,
          "en": "as a React developer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 370.89,
          "end": 375.75,
          "en": "Because the last alternative is to use a variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 375.75,
          "end": 377.73,
          "en": "let's say a variable we create here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 377.73,
          "end": 379.653,
          "en": "which we could name tabContent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 380.88,
          "end": 385.02,
          "en": "But now in here, I'm not trying to store some state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 385.02,
          "end": 387.99,
          "en": "because as you learned, that won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 387.99,
          "end": 391.32,
          "en": "Instead in here, I wanna store some JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 391.32,
          "end": 394.38,
          "en": "Because JSX code cannot just be returned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 394.38,
          "end": 397.59000000000003,
          "en": "instead, you can use it as a regular value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 397.59000000000003,
          "end": 399.93,
          "en": "anywhere in your component code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 399.93,
          "end": 404.07,
          "en": "So you can also store it in variables and constants.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 404.07,
          "end": 406.83,
          "en": "So therefore here, I'll now grab this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 406.83,
          "end": 409.383,
          "en": "cut it, and remove this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 411.57,
          "end": 414.003,
          "en": "and store this paragraph and tabContent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 415.32,
          "end": 417.51,
          "en": "But now here, I'll add a if check",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 417.51,
          "end": 420.153,
          "en": "and check if we have a selected topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 421.14,
          "end": 423.933,
          "en": "And if that's the case, I'll overwrite tabContent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 424.8,
          "end": 426.54,
          "en": "And I now wanna store my div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 426.54,
          "end": 430.02,
          "en": "with the actual content as a value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 430.02,
          "end": 435.02,
          "en": "So now we can grab this div here and remove this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 437.85,
          "end": 441.33299999999997,
          "en": "and then store this div here if this condition is met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 443.22,
          "end": 445.5,
          "en": "So with that, we're now setting this variable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 445.5,
          "end": 448.56,
          "en": "before we return the JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 136,
